      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대의 힘을 이용한다.\n싸우고 있는 상대의 공격이\n높을수록 데미지가 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用對手的力量進行攻擊。\n對手的攻擊越高，\n給予對手的傷害越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur utilise la force de l’ennemi. Plus l’Attaque de\nl’ennemi est élevée, plus le lanceur inflige de dégâts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender macht sich die Kraft des Zieles zunutze.\nJe höher dessen Angriff, desto mehr Schaden richtet\ndie Attacke an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario emplea la fuerza del objetivo para atacarlo.\nCuanto mayor es el Ataque del objetivo, más daño\nprovoca.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa sfrutta la forza del bersaglio. Il danno\ninflitto è proporzionale all’Attacco del nemico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user turns the target’s power against it.\nThe higher the target’s Attack stat, the greater\nthe damage it deals.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手の　力を　利用する。\n戦っている　相手の　攻撃が\n高いほど　ダメージが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用对手的力量进行攻击。\n正和自己战斗的对手，\n其攻击越高，伤害越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario emplea la fuerza del objetivo para atacarlo.\nCuanto mayor es el Ataque del objetivo, más daño\nprovoca.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "２ターンの　あいだ　ねむり　つづける。\nじぶんの　ＨＰと　じょうたいいじょうを\nすべて　かいふく　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "2턴 동안 계속 잠잔다.\n자신의 HP와 상태 이상을\n모두 회복한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "連續睡２回合。\n回復自己的全部ＨＰ\n以及治癒所有異常狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur regagne tous ses PV et soigne ses altérations\nde statut, puis il dort pendant deux tours.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender wird vollkommen geheilt, von allen\nStatusproblemen befreit und schläft die folgenden\nzwei Runden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Restaura todos los PS y cura todos los problemas de\nestado del usuario, que se duerme los dos turnos\nsiguientes.",
